      "title": "Build Stripe Payment Webhook Handler with Idempotency",
      "description": "Implement a robust webhook handler for Stripe payment events.\n\nEvents to Handle:\n- payment_intent.succeeded\n- payment_intent.payment_failed\n- charge.refunded\n- customer.subscription.updated\n\nRequirements:\n- Verify webhook signatures\n- Idempotent processing (handle retries safely)\n- Store events for audit trail\n- Emit internal events for downstream processing\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n1. FastAPI endpoint with proper error handling\n2. Idempotency key tracking to prevent duplicate processing\n3. Unit tests with mocked Stripe events\n4. Logging with correlation IDs\n5. Documentation of event flow\n\nDeliverables: Python module + tests + docs\n",
